; Documentation of the decoded values; wire is fixed binary, not CBOR.
; Common LM link header24 + AES-GCM ciphertext(payload) + tag16.
; POWER frame kind8 is authenticated 1-hop only, and requires power capability.
power-poll = [subtype: 1, version: 1, rx-credit: 0..65535,
 poll-nonce: 1..18446744073709551615, revision-hint: 0..4294967295,
 planned-interval-ms: 0..86400000, window-ms: 1..65535,
 flags: 0, reserved: 0]
power-grant = [subtype: 2, version: 1, pending-frames: 0..65535,
 poll-nonce: 1..18446744073709551615, window-ttl-ms: 1..65535,
 granted-credit: 0..65535, reserved: 0, reason: 0..4294967295]
; struct_formats registry is authoritative for widths: poll28/grant24.
; Semantic checks: matching parent/session, nonce echo, credit bounded by request,
; grant TTL <= first poll window, no deadline reset on retry, unknown flags reject.
